{"cast":"moss","group":"three","bank":"three.cd752627f1.bin","lines":[{"id":"three.intro.01","moment":"three.intro","text":"Downtown comes to the forest! Six shooters, five racks, sixty seconds, and the money balls. Top three move on.","off":0,"len":30658,"sec":6.241},{"id":"three.intro.02","moment":"three.intro","text":"Welcome to Downtown at Canopy Court! Five racks, sixty seconds on the clock, six shooters, and only the top three advance.","off":30658,"len":33244,"sec":6.896},{"id":"three.intro.03","moment":"three.intro","text":"Ha, grab a stump, it's Downtown! Six shooters, five racks, sixty seconds. Watch those money balls. Top three go through.","off":63902,"len":32370,"sec":6.74},{"id":"three.go.01","moment":"three.go","text":"Clock's running, go!","off":96272,"len":9437,"sec":1.125},{"id":"three.go.02","moment":"three.go","text":"Let it rain!","off":105709,"len":7896,"sec":0.807},{"id":"three.go.03","moment":"three.go","text":"Rise and shine, shooter!","off":113605,"len":9752,"sec":1.177},{"id":"three.rack.01","moment":"three.rack","text":"Next stump over!","off":123357,"len":9119,"sec":1.046},{"id":"three.rack.02","moment":"three.rack","text":"On to the next branch!","off":132476,"len":9688,"sec":1.165},{"id":"three.rack.03","moment":"three.rack","text":"Moving along.","off":142164,"len":8112,"sec":0.85},{"id":"three.rack.04","moment":"three.rack","text":"New rack, keep flowing.","off":150276,"len":9317,"sec":1.148},{"id":"three.lastrack.01","moment":"three.lastrack","text":"Last rack! Let it all fall!","off":159593,"len":10340,"sec":1.364},{"id":"three.lastrack.02","moment":"three.lastrack","text":"Final rack, top of the tree!","off":169933,"len":11165,"sec":1.464},{"id":"three.lastrack.03","moment":"three.lastrack","text":"One rack left. Stay rooted.","off":181098,"len":11574,"sec":1.548},{"id":"three.money.01","moment":"three.money","text":"This one grows double!","off":192672,"len":9661,"sec":1.161},{"id":"three.money.02","moment":"three.money","text":"